	["\"A reward for completing Quests throughout Azeroth.\""] = "\"아제로스 전역에서 퀘스트를 완료한 보상입니다.\"",
	["Restores $s1 to $s2 health and mana to a friendly target and attempts to dispel any polymorph effects from them.\nReduced effectiveness against polymorph effects from casters of level $s3 and higher."] =
