    ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant a cloak to increase armor by $s1"] = "망토에 영구적으로 마법을 부여하여 방어도를 $s1만큼 증가시킵니다.",
    ["Your spells and abilities have a chance to grant $s1 Strength for $s2 sec."] =
