    ["Teaches you how to sew a Red Linen Vest."] = "붉은색 리넨 조끼를 만드는 방법을 배웁니다.",
    ["Deals $s1 Nature damage every $s2 sec to any enemy in an $s3 yard radius around the caster for $s4 sec."] =
